# Architecture

## Components
- `agent/llm.py`: model client interface. Hosted baseline now, local fine-tuned model later.
- `agent/loop.py`: tool-calling loop with iteration cap, repeat detection, and confirmation gate.
- `agent/tools.py`: tool implementations. Schemas come from `shared/tool_schemas.json`.
- `eval/`: gold cases, metrics, and the runner.
- `api/`: FastAPI service used by the web and iOS clients.

